        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Introduction</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have arrived at a research facility to rescue your younger sister. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is to reach the 10th floor and save her.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Progression</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you detect an anomaly, exit through the right door. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If no anomaly is detected, exit through the left door. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upon reaching the 10th floor, a corridor will appear in front of you, leading to a room where your younger sister is located.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiple Endings</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices and actions will determine the ending. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are a total of three possible endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find hidden items and interact with specific anomalies to uncover more.</p>",
